    "body": "On 25 May 2018, the [EU General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR)](https://www.eugdpr.org/) will come into enforcement. SilverStripe should decide to what extent it should change the core code to accommodate this change, to what extent it can provide advice about best practices, and to what extent it is left up to the individual site owners.\r\n\r\nIn addition, best practices can be established for what data is stored by default, what is done with that data, and how it is stored, processed, and disclosed.\r\n\r\nAt minimum a blogpost or docs update that addressed potential areas to look at or config settings to tweak would be a great bout of confidence for the community.",
